  "preview": {
    "tag": "main-566c7d7",
    "title": "fix: give games the Xbox 360 axis layout when Steam Input is off",
    "summary": "With Controller: Xbox 360 controller and a game that has Steam Input off, the game reads our raw virtual pad directly. That pad advertised its triggers as ABSGAS/ABSBRAKE, after the sticks, instead of ABSZ/ABSRZ where a real 360 pad (xpad) has them. Wine and SDL place axes by their order, so the game read:\n\u2022 right stick X as the left trigger\n\u2022 right stick Y as right stick X\n\u2022 the right trigger as right stick Y (a released trigger holds the camera pointing up)\n\u2022 the left trigger as the right trigger",
    "commit": "566c7d703a67c069b049634b45be68d8dcaa293f",
